              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.15+DEU.28.16+DEU.28.17+DEU.28.18+DEU.28.19+DEU.28.20+DEU.28.21+DEU.28.22+DEU.28.23+DEU.28.24+DEU.28.25+DEU.28.26+DEU.28.27+DEU.28.28+DEU.28.29+DEU.28.30+DEU.28.31+DEU.28.32+DEU.28.33+DEU.28.34+DEU.28.35+DEU.28.36+DEU.28.37+DEU.28.38+DEU.28.39+DEU.28.40+DEU.28.41+DEU.28.42+DEU.28.43+DEU.28.44+DEU.28.45+DEU.28.46+DEU.28.47+DEU.28.48+DEU.28.49+DEU.28.50+DEU.28.51+DEU.28.52+DEU.28.53+DEU.28.54+DEU.28.55+DEU.28.56+DEU.28.57+DEU.28.58+DEU.28.59+DEU.28.60+DEU.28.61+DEU.28.62+DEU.28.63+DEU.28.64+DEU.28.65+DEU.28.66+DEU.28.67+DEU.28.68"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 28:15-68",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento tek wubiwinjo dwanda ngo, man wubitimo lembang’ola maeni ceke ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man tek wubikwero cik para, man tek ng’eyong’ec mu bidagu lembapoka para, ketho nia wukwero timo lembang’ola para ceke, ento wuturo lembariba para; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an bende abitimo maeni i kumwu: abiketho ndiri i wiwu, en e thokor ku cekkum, ma bicamu wang’, ma bimogo ng’eyong’ec de; e wubicoyo kodhi mu mananu, kum judegiwu bicame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abiketho wang’a i kumwu, jubigoyowu de i wang’ judegiwu: ju m’udaguwu bibimo wiwu; e wubiringo ma ng’atu moko mbe m’uriemowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek wubiwinjo dwanda ngo asu kum gin maeni, abilund ponjowu wang’ abiro kendo pi dubo mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abituro kuhaya mi tego mu: man abidwoko polo mu calu nyunyu, ng’om mu de calu mola; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e tego mu bithum mananu; kum ng’om mu bicego nyaine ngo, kadok yen mi ng’ombe de bicego nyinge ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek wuwotho ku co ira, man wubiwinjo dwanda ngo, abikelo masendi wang’ abiro kendo i kumwu calku dubo mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abioro yedi m’i thim i kindwu, ma bikwalu nyithindho mu, ma binyotho lim mu de, ma bijwigo welwu de; e yo mu bicido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
